        </figure>
        <div class="wd-featured__copy" data-reveal>
          <p class="wd-eyebrow">Featured love story</p>
          <h2 id="wd-featured-title" class="wd-display wd-featured__title">A love story,<br />beautifully told.</h2>
          <p class="wd-featured__names">Alex &amp; Taylor</p>
          <p class="wd-featured__place">Lake Como, Italy</p>
          <p class="wd-featured__para">A celebration filled with heartfelt moments, breathtaking views, and a love that brought together family and friends from around the world. Their wedding day was a perfect reflection of who they are — elegant, joyful, and deeply meaningful.</p>
